# https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file

**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.classpath
**/.dockerignore
**/.env
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/bin
**/charts
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*
**/Dockerfile*
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/obj
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
LICENSE
README.md
# Worker build context is the REPO ROOT (needs packages/core + packages/ingestion).
# Exclude everything heavy/irrelevant — esp. a local .venv (which has torch) and .env.
.venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.uv-cache-local/

.env
**/.env
!.env.example

# Frontend + reranker-heavy retrieval are NOT in the worker image
apps/web/
packages/retrieval/

demo/
Prompts/
.git/
.github/
.codex-runtime/
docs/
*.md
logs/
eval_report.json
chroma_db/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
